## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

❌ **Don't use raw database connections:**
```javascript
// BAD
const client = await pool.connect();
const result = await client.query(query);

// GOOD
const result = await executeQuery(query, params);
```

❌ **Don't ignore query performance:**
```javascript
// BAD
const result = await executeQuery(query, params);
res.json(result.rows);

// GOOD
const startTime = startTiming();
const result = await executeQuery(query, params);
const duration = endTiming(startTime);
sendSuccessResponse(res, result.rows, 'QUERY_TYPE', duration);
```

❌ **Don't use string concatenation for queries:**
```javascript
// BAD - SQL injection risk
const query = `SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = '${name}'`;

// GOOD - Parameterized query
const query = 'SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = $1';
const result = await executeQuery(query, [name]);
```

❌ **Don't forget error handling:**
```javascript
// BAD
const result = await executeQuery(query, params);
res.json(result.rows);

// GOOD
try {
  const result = await executeQuery(query, params);
  sendSuccessResponse(res, result.rows, 'QUERY_TYPE', duration);
} catch (error) {
  sendErrorResponse(res, error, 'Database operation failed');
}
```